  "id": "emotional-charge",
  "term": "emotional charge",
  "definition": "Emotional charge is the emotional quality carried by a stimulus, such as music, that gives it a positive or negative feeling tone. In this context, it refers to the valence of the music’s emotional impact and how that emotional tone can influence thinking and creative performance.",
